Date: Wed, 18 Nov 2026 16:57:13 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 04/23] Header and top-bar capsules (header_capsule,
 top_bar_capsule)

header_capsule puts dark glass behind the greeting, clock, date and weather,
sized to them, so the header reads over a bright wallpaper. top_bar_capsule
puts the top buttons inside one dark glass capsule level with the header's
middle; each button fills white only while focused and the VPN button keeps
its state ring. Both off by default; a theme turns them on.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
